@startuml 05_class_agent
title Agent service and setup companion - Windows / Linux
class AgentConfig {
 +coordinatorUrl: HTTPS_URL
 +hostId: UUID?
 +platform: String
 +intervalSeconds: Int
}
class ProtectedCredentialStore {
 +createRandomReportingCredential()
 +loadOrFail(): Secret
 +storeOwnedSecret(secret)
 +deleteOnExplicitReset()
}
class LocalIpcServer {
 +listenOnlyToAuthorizedLocalCaller()
 +beginPairing()
 +status(): AgentStatus
}
class SetupUi {
 +showPairingCode()
 +showConnectionState()
 +showDataCollectionConsent()
 +requestRepair()
}
class PairingClient {
 +createSession(reportTokenHash, metadata)
 +pollWithPrivateDeviceCode()
 +cancel()
}
class ServiceLifecycle {
 +startAtBoot()
 +restartWithBackoff()
 +stop()
}
class MetricsCollector {
 +collectCpu(): Float
 +collectRam(): Memory
 +collectDisk(): Disk
}
class ProcessCollector {
 +topProcesses(limit): ProcessEntry[*]
}
class ReportComposer {
 +assemble(metrics, processes): AgentReport
}
class HttpReporter {
 +sendHttps(report, reportingCredential): AcceptedReport
}
class RetryPolicy {
 +backoff(attempt): Duration
}
SetupUi --> LocalIpcServer : protected pipe / UNIX socket
LocalIpcServer --> PairingClient
PairingClient --> ProtectedCredentialStore
ServiceLifecycle --> LocalIpcServer
ServiceLifecycle --> MetricsCollector
ServiceLifecycle --> ProcessCollector
ServiceLifecycle --> ReportComposer
ServiceLifecycle --> HttpReporter
HttpReporter --> ProtectedCredentialStore
HttpReporter --> RetryPolicy
HttpReporter --> AgentConfig
note right of SetupUi
 UI may close while service continues reporting.
 No Python/WSL/DB string exposed to end user.
end note
@enduml
